      "content": "```\n# Initialize the code base\ncodebase init\n\n# Set the path to the code base\ncodebase path /path/to/codebase\n\n# Extract high-level concepts\ncodebase concepts extract --level high\n\n# List the extracted concepts\ncodebase concepts list\n```",
